<center><b>
UNITED STATES<br>
DEPARTMENT OF LABOR<br>
MINE SAFETY AND HEALTH ADMINISTRATION
<br><br>
COAL MINE SAFETY AND HEALTH
<br><br>
REPORT OF INVESTIGATION
<br><br>
Underground Coal Mine
<br><br>
Fatal Fall of Roof Accident<br>
July 12, 2005
<br><br>
NEWCO #1 Mine<br>
Sunrise Coal Company, LLC<br>
Jefferson County, Alabama<br>
I.D. No. 01-03102
<br><br>
Accident Investigators
<br><br>
David H. Allen, Jr.<br>
Mining Engineer
<br><br>
Timothy Foster<br>
Mine Safety and Health Inspector
<br><br>
Michael Gauna<br>
Mining Engineer
<br><br>
Paul Tyrna<br>
Mining Engineer
<br><br>
Ronny E. Jones<br>
